    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u2y1](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u2y1) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Oct 17 2026 44km W of Kuzdar Tehsil. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 28.0179 longitude 66.1708. It impacted 114531 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
